{
 "description": "Shared request-parameter vectors (third audit #2). Each case starts from base[endpoint] with \"$MODEL\" replaced by a tools-capable model, applies set (keys override, null values are sent as JSON null) and remove, and POSTs it to /v1/chat/completions (chat) or /v1/messages (messages). status 400 cases MUST be rejected before anything is signed or sent to the device, with code BAD_REQUEST and the given top-level param (OpenAI: error.param; Anthropic: error.lmbp_param). status 200 cases MUST reach the device; run lists task.run payload fields that MUST have exactly these values, run_absent fields that MUST be absent. Every task.run MUST validate against spec/schemas/task.run.payload.json.",
 "base": {
  "chat": {
   "model": "$MODEL",
   "messages": [
    {
     "role": "user",
     "content": "hi"
    }
   ]
  },
  "messages": {
   "model": "$MODEL",
   "max_tokens": 16,
   "messages": [
    {
     "role": "user",
     "content": "hi"
    }
   ]
  }
 },
 "cases": [
